574
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:05,351
How you shooting this, Vikram?
Wide open?

575
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:07,351
Uh, light, 5.6.

576
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:10,637
[ Panting, Sighs 1

577
00:38:19,960 --> 00:38:22,759
<i>[ Zissou Narrating ]As always,
even in the most challenging circumstances...</i>

578
00:38:22,840 --> 00:38:25,753
<i>the members of Team Zissou
find ways to keep morale high.</i>

579
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:29,151
- <i>[ Shouts ]</i>
- <i>[All Cheering]</i>

580
00:38:31,360 --> 00:38:33,271
<i>Wait. Hold it.</i>

581
00:38:33,360 --> 00:38:35,351
<i>Is that a distress bark?</i>

582
00:38:39,320 --> 00:38:41,357
<i>Is something wounded out there?</i>

583
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:44,996
