We quickly locate the source of the mysterious cry.</i>

584
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:49,071
<i>What is she, Steve?</i>

585
00:38:49,160 --> 00:38:51,071
<i>A wild snow mongoose.</i>

586
00:38:51,160 --> 00:38:53,071
<i>We thought they were extinct.</i>

587
00:38:53,160 --> 00:38:55,071
<i>Her ankle's broken.</i>

588
00:38:55,160 --> 00:38:56,753
- <i>Ogata.</i>
- <i>Yeah?</i>

589
00:38:56,840 --> 00:38:59,753
<i>Run and get some hot milk
and put these guys in the incubator.</i>

590
00:38:59,840 --> 00:39:03,435
<i>[Zissou] We radio for the emergency transport
of our rare, beautiful new friends.</i>

591
00:39:07,040 --> 00:39:09,475
That's what
it used to be like.

592
00:39:09,560 --> 00:39:11,551
